course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:96:- `_ai-context/` — AI-integration docs (orchestration, loop history).
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:110:To run autonomous execution, see [[claude-codex-loop]].
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:714:name: custom-convergence-loop
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:715:description: Run a plan-aligned Claude/Codex convergence loop where Claude acts as orchestrator/reviewer, Codex executes and verifies, optional read-only research agents gather narrow evidence, and the loop continues until evidence-backed completion, high-confidence DONE readiness review, browser proof, and conditional PR merge/posting. Use when the user asks to have Claude direct the next step, run a Claude/Codex loop, make Claude the orchestrator and Codex the executor, converge with Claude, or execute with repeated Claude feedback.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:728:- `goal_id`: stable short identifier for the loop.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:729:- `goal_description`: concrete outcome the loop must reach.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:741:Before starting the loop, do a control-surface preflight so required tools are not discovered missing halfway through execution.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:745:- Which Claude surface the loop will use first.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:749:- Whether any repo/provider CLIs the loop explicitly depends on are installed and callable now.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:754:- Treat `claude_surface_unavailable` as a preflight classification whenever the chosen surface cannot be controlled at loop start. Do not wait until late in the loop to discover this.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:756:- If final proof depends on Chrome, app automation, DevTools, or another control plane, verify that the relevant tool path exists before the loop commits to a plan that requires it.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:759:  - narrow the loop so it does not depend on that tool, or
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:760:  - stop before the loop meaningfully starts and report the exact missing tool/control plane as a preflight gap.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:791:   - If neither surface can be controlled, produce the exact Claude prompt and record `claude_surface_unavailable` as a loop evidence gap.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:798:Allowed only when the loop goal explicitly grants it:
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:823:- The current PR is the intended PR for this loop, is not a draft, has no merge conflicts, and GitHub reports passing required checks or an equivalent clean merge state.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:913:Claude should not be the first reviewer of Codex's code. Once the loop has a code diff, PR branch, or changed implementation surface, invoke `custom-manual-code-review` before asking Claude for code review, final readiness, or another next-step decision that depends on the changed code.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:926:Do not treat a local failure as the end of the loop until Claude has been used to challenge the blocker, except when the next step requires immediate user authorization that Claude cannot grant.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:970:Reject or defer actions that fail these checks. Record the rejection reason in the loop ledger and feed it back to Claude in the next packet.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:1001:When the loop reaches PR review, invoke `custom-manual-code-review` rather than recreating its workflow. Treat its consolidated findings, fixes, verification, and Claude follow-up as evidence in this loop.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b07_credit-loop.png.log:1003:When the loop needs a Claude handoff prompt but no execution loop, prefer `custom-status-prompt`.
