course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b05_milestone-path.png.log:721:- `goal_description`: concrete outcome the loop must reach.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b05_milestone-path.png.log:733:Before starting the loop, do a control-surface preflight so required tools are not discovered missing halfway through execution.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b05_milestone-path.png.log:737:- Which Claude surface the loop will use first.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b05_milestone-path.png.log:741:- Whether any repo/provider CLIs the loop explicitly depends on are installed and callable now.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b05_milestone-path.png.log:746:- Treat `claude_surface_unavailable` as a preflight classification whenever the chosen surface cannot be controlled at loop start. Do not wait until late in the loop to discover this.
