course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b05_milestone-path.png.log:752:  - stop before the loop meaningfully starts and report the exact missing tool/control plane as a preflight gap.
course-assets/scenes/module-17/_logs/m17_L17_b05_milestone-path.png.log:783:   - If neither surface can be controlled, produce the exact Claude prompt and record `claude_surface_unavailable` as a loop evidence gap.
